      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Pick the track",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>When the drone is up, tap <strong>Took off</strong> on the mission's card, then tap its track, here <strong>KOIRA11</strong>. <strong>Drone track</strong> on the card changes a wrong pick.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/1815f43c98d4f8bd.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Eyes on target",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>Eyes on target</strong> shows while the drone's camera looks at the target. <strong>KOIRA11 SPI</strong> on the map marks where it looks.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/ff381e2b9f695459.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Mark where it looks",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>Mark finding</strong> opens a new marker where the camera looks. Pick what you see and tap <strong>Place</strong>, then send it with <strong>Send to…</strong> in OpenDefence Main.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c43e9d7303053cf8.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Drone gone?",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>When the track sends nothing for a minute, the card asks. Tap <strong>Not yet</strong> or the answer it suggests, here <strong>Landed</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/0ceb87223616db23.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
